    "text": "DOMINICA SECUNDA IN QUADRAGESSIMA Men \u00fea leofeste we wyll\u00e6\u00f0 her specan feawum\nRiht ileaf\u00e6 is \u00fe\u00e6t mon ilyfe on F\u00e6der & on Sune & on Haligne Gast, \u00fe\u00e6t heo ne beon na \u00f0reo God\u00e6s, ac\n\u00dee hiht is \u00fe\u00e6t mon hopige to \u00feam ecen life, & on \u00feam unasegendlice mede \u00fee Drihten h\u00e6f\u00f0 ihaten \u00e6lc\n\u00d0eo lufe is \u00f0onne \u00feridde; \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t we beon ifulleD mid \u00feare so\u00fean lufe to Gode & to ure nextum; we\nMen, nu we iher\u00e6\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t God on us eardig\u00e6n wule, & we on him, is us swi\u00f0e mycel \u00f0earf \u00fe\u00e6t we us\n\u00deurh \u00f0as six \u00feing sceal \u00e6lc cristene mon hine sylfne gearwigan & cl\u00e6nsig\u00e6n, \u00fe\u00e6t he wyr\u00f0e beo \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00de\u00e6t is andetnes, & d\u00e6dbot, & halige wecc\u00e6n, ant festene, & gebedu, & \u00e6lmesseded\u00e6.\n\u00d0eo andetnes is to donne be allum \u00feam synnum \u00fee \u00f0urhtogene beo\u00f0, o\u00f0\u00f0e on \u00feance, o\u00f0\u00f0e on sp\u00e6ce,\nGod wiln\u00e6\u00f0 andetnesse, for \u00f0am \u00fee he wyle ure gultes forgif\u00e6n.\n\u00d0eo andetnes us de\u00fe, \u00e6g\u00f0er ge heo us h\u00e6le\u00f0, ge heo us rihtwis\u00e6\u00f0; & eac heo syl\u00fe us ure sunne\nAl \u00fe\u00e6re forgyfenesse tohop\u00e6 is on \u00feare andetness\u00e6; for \u00feig we ne magon na hale wur\u00f0an on \u00f0am\nBe \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00f0 Salomon, \u00f0e \u00fee bihyd his synn\u00e6 & heom nele andetten, ne wur\u00f0 he nefre ofer eor\u00f0an\n\u00c6fter \u00feare andetnesse mon sceal underfon d\u00e6dbote.\nBe \u00fe\u00e6re cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fee H\u00e6lend on his godspelle, Penitentiam agite, adpropinquabit enim regnum celorum;\nAnd Iohannes \u00fee godspellere cw\u00e6\u00f0, Do\u00fe swylce westm\u00e6s swylce beon d\u00e6dbote wur\u00f0e.\nHe de\u00fe \u00f0onne \u00fea w\u00e6stm\u00e6s \u00fee beo\u00f0 d\u00e6dbote wur\u00f0e, \u00f0e \u00fea idon\u00e6n gylt\u00e6s bew\u00e6p\u00e6\u00f0, ant heom eft ne\nSwa hit on o\u00f0re stowe be \u00feam icw\u00e6den is, Ne adicias peccatum super peccatum; \u00fe\u00e6t is, Ne ec\u00e6 \u00feu \u00fea\nFor \u00feam \u00fee mon \u00fee \u00f0a synne edl\u00e6c\u00f0 \u00fee he \u00e6r bette & geswikennesse behaten h\u00e6fde, ant hit is \u00e6fter\nUre Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 eft \u00feurh Ysayam \u00feone witeg\u00e6, Lauamini & mundi estote; A\u00fewea\u00f0 eow & beo\u00f0\n\u00dee mon hine a\u00f0weah\u00f0 ant bi\u00f0 cl\u00e6ne, \u00fee \u00f0a for\u00f0awitene gylt\u00e6s bewep\u00e6\u00f0 & mid tearum a\u00f0weah\u00f0, & eft\n& \u00fee mon hine \u00f0weah\u00f0 & ne bi\u00f0 na cl\u00e6ne, \u00fee \u00f0e bewep\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fea gult\u00e6s \u00fee he \u00e6r dyde, & na \u00fee ra\u00f0or ne\nEornostlice is to witenne \u00feet \u00fe\u00e6t is so\u00f0 d\u00e6dbot \u00fee mon mid mycele sti\u00f0nesse de\u00fe, & n\u00e6fre \u00e6ft \u00fe\u00e6t\nNis na \u00feeo d\u00e6dbote be \u00feare geare it\u00e6le idemed, ac bi \u00feare biternesse \u00fe\u00e6s modes.\nFor\u00feam \u00f0e God ne sceaw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fea loncsumnesse \u00feare tide, ac he gesmea\u00f0 \u00fea wilnunge & \u00fea geornfulnesse\n\u00deeah \u00f0e \u00feenne hwylc mon beo swi\u00f0e synful, & arleas, & unrihtwis, ne sceal he him tweonig\u00e6n \u00fe\u00e6t he\nFor\u00fean \u00f0e Godes mildheortnes help\u00f0 \u00e6lcne \u00feare \u00fee on \u00feisse life wyle d\u00e6dbote don.\n& \u00fea \u00f0e her on life forhogi\u00e6\u00f0 o\u00f0\u00f0e forscami\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t heo nell\u00e6\u00fe reowsunge don & heor\u00e6 gylt\u00e6s\nBe \u00feare stowe \u00fee H\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0 on \u00feam godspelle, Ibi erit fletus & stridor dentium, \u00feer bi\u00fe eagene wop\n& \u00feer nan o\u00f0er \u00feinc ne bi\u00fe isegen, buton edwit & onrop.\n& \u00feer ne bi\u00f0 nan o\u00f0er \u00feing ihyrd, buten brune, & chile, & \u00feurst, & hungor, & alle earm\u00fee swa fela swa\nMen, us is swi\u00f0e mycel to warnigenne wi\u00f0 \u00feone ormeten brogan \u00feare ungeendedlicr\u00e6 hellewit\u00e6; & we\nNu \u00feenc\u00f0 monig mon on his mode, \u00feenne he \u00feis iher\u00e6\u00f0, Hwi sceal ic don mycele d\u00e6dbote?\nIc nabbe n\u00e6nne healicne gylt idon.\nAc ne cw\u00e6\u00f0e nan mon \u00fe\u00e6t, for\u00fean \u00fee nan mon ne bi\u00fe swi\u00f0or biswicon \u00feenne \u00fee \u00f0e hine sylfne selostne\n\u00deonne \u00fee H\u00e6lend be \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00f0 on \u00feam godspelle, Omne ociosum uerbum quod locuti fuerint homines,\nMid \u00feare d\u00e6dbote mon sceal lufian halige wecc\u00e6n; for\u00fean \u00fee \u00f0a w\u00e6stm\u00e6s \u00f0e of \u00feare wecc\u00e6n cum\u00e6\u00f0\nIs eac monnum to witenne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6s monnes w\u00e6cce \u00fee wac\u00e6\u00f0 for his oferfulle, ant for oferdrynce, & for\nFor \u00feam \u00f0e \u00f0e deofol ne sl\u00e6p\u00e6\u00f0 n\u00e6fre, ac a he bi\u00f0 wacigende & syrwigende hu he moncun mage\nAc us gedafen\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we waci\u00e6n, swa swa \u00fee witeg\u00e6 cw\u00e6\u00f0, Media nocte surgebam ad confitendum\n\u00deonun us myneg\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fee H\u00e6lend on \u00f0am godspelle his leorningcniht\u00e6s to wacigenne, & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, Beati\nAnd cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00e6ft on o\u00f0rum stowum, Vigilate ergo, quia nescitis in qua hora dominus uester uenturus sit;\nWacig\u00e6\u00f0; for\u00feam \u00fee ge nyten on hwylcere tide eower Drihten cyme\u00f0; hw\u00e6\u00f0er he cyme on efen, o\u00f0\u00f0e\n\u00deenne is us mid \u00feisse w\u00e6ccan swi\u00fee to smeagenne & to leornigenne embe ure Drihtines bodu &\nSwa hwylc mon swa wyle symle mid Gode wuni\u00e6n, he sceal ilomlice hine to Gode biddan, & ilomlice\n& \u00fee \u00fee reden cunne, \u00fee r\u00e6de; \u00fee \u00fee nan ne cunne he lyste \u00feam redendan.\nHw\u00e6t, we iher\u00e6\u00f0 \u00feet \u00fea unrihtwis\u00e6n gitser\u00e6s and reafer\u00e6s geond weorulde smealice acsi\u00e6\u00f0, ant eacc\n& \u00feonne heo hit mest ig\u00e6derot habb\u00e6\u00f0, \u00feonne sceolen heo \u00feurh sum ungelimp \u00feisses lifes \u00e6ll hit\n\u00deonne is swi\u00f0e mycel \u00f0earf \u00fe\u00e6t we ilomlice smeagen & leorni\u00e6n hu we magen ure Drihtines bodum\nMen, we sculon eac mid o\u00f0re godum dedum swi\u00f0e georne f\u00e6sten lufigen, & hure\u00feing\u00e6 on \u00feas halg\u00e6n\nSwa Hieronimus be \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t f\u00e6sten acl\u00e6nsige \u00fe\u00e6s monnes heortan & \u00feone lichame; & hit\nAugustinus cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea halgan festen beo\u00f0 swy\u00fee stronge flan ongean deofles costung\u00e6, & heom\n\u00de\u00e6t is to wit\u00e6nne, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a festenu mid o\u00f0re godum dedum beo\u00f0 swi\u00f0e anfencge; & \u00fe\u00e6t fulfremede\n\u00c6r\u00e6st heo ye\u00f0 \u00f0a andweardan god; & heo gegearuw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00feare synne forgifennesse; & heo\n& heo alys\u00e6\u00f0 hine from dea\u00fee, & from ece wite; & heo ascyr\u00e6\u00f0 hine from deofl\u00e6n, & heo \u00feud hine to\n\u00deeo \u00e6lmes is \u00f0reor\u00e6 cynne; an is lichamlic, \u00fe\u00e6t mon \u00feam \u00feearfum sylle \u00fe\u00e6t to gode mage; & \u00fea twa\nO\u00feer is \u00fe\u00e6t mon forgife \u00feam \u00f0e wi\u00f0 him agylt\u00e6\u00f0.\nO\u00feer \u00fe\u00e6t mon \u00feone unwis\u00e6n & \u00feone dwelligendan \u00fereage & hine to rihte w\u00e6ge cyrre.\nGif we \u00feenne \u00f0as six m\u00e6gnu heald\u00e6\u00fe & heom geornlice lufig\u00e6\u00fe, \u00feone wun\u00e6\u00fe God mid us, & we mid\n\u00de\u00e6r ne bi\u00f0 nan wi\u00f0erwinn\u00e6, ne nan drefednesse, ne nan unrotnes; ac \u00fe\u00e6r habb\u00e6\u00f0 alle halige\nAMEN.",
